06 – Perplexity Citation Check

Project: RupeeRise – AI Fact-Checking Lab
Tool tested: Perplexity AI
Purpose: To check whether AI-generated financial claims are supported by their cited sources.

1. Claims Checked

No.	Claim	Source URL	Source Publisher	Result
1	UPI transaction volume and value in October 2026	[Paste link]	[Publisher]	[Supported / Partially supported / Not supported / Unverified]
